<article class="seo-content" style="margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2>Why calculate true out-of-pocket costs with points?</h2>
  <p>Award travel is rarely 100% free. Transatlantic and transpacific flights often come with significant government taxes and fuel surcharges, while hotels in premier destinations frequently charge daily resort or destination fees. This calculator bridges the gap between your macro vacation budget and micro redemption choices, ensuring you maximize value and budget accurately.</p>

